"""
# Performance Analysis and Collection Refactoring System Specification

**Status:** Implementing
**Feature IDs:** PERF-COST-001, PERF-COST-002, PERF-STYLE-001, PERF-ALG-001, PERF-ALLOC-001, PERF-CONTRACT-001, PERF-CONTRACT-002, PERF-ANALYSIS-001, PERF-FIX-001
**Keywords:** performance-analysis, collection-refactoring, caller-propagation, loop-idiom, edit-transaction, resource-contract

## Overview
System-level BDD scenarios verifying shared `perf_analysis_contracts_v1` side-table
contracts, `CollectionOperationRegistry` and `builtin_collection` identity admission,
`collect_hir_perf_facts` caller/callee fact extraction, `DiagnosticBatchV1` and
revision-bound `EditTransaction` safe-fix gates, three-valued resource contract
outcomes (`Verified | Refuted | Unproved`), baseline model-migration separation,
and behavioral trace equivalence across imperative loops and collection pipelines.

Canonical plan: `doc/03_plan/compiler/performance_analysis_and_collection_refactoring_2026-11-18.md`
Scenario manual: `doc/06_spec/03_system/app/compiler/feature/perf_analysis_collection_refactoring_spec.md`
"""

